    "name": "World Turned Stone: Apocalypse",
    "steam_appid": 3128770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128770/extras/97c6ff488c4fa14e86821bc516958cae.poster.avif?t=1754425166\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128770/extras/97c6ff488c4fa14e86821bc516958cae.webm?t=1754425166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128770/extras/97c6ff488c4fa14e86821bc516958cae.mp4?t=1754425166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>This is the prologue for the full game and it includes the first stage of terraforming the world from the beginning of the apocalypse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prologue owners will get a special discount on the full game.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization has turned STONE.<br>Revive the people, terraform the world, defend against the apocalypse, and rebuild civilization from the stone age to advanced technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dust and statues are all that\u2019s left - it\u2019s up to you now, survivor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Survival Crafting Base Building Game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather dust and craft your way up to rebuilding civilization, from the stone age to advanced technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive people from the stone and build homes for them to work at your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new workstations and machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make water and food to maintain your character in the harsh apocalypse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against mutants from the apocalypse using melee/ranged weapons and defense structures like wooden spikes and castle walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform the world by building machines to alter the atmosphere and watch the world transform to its original state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a tech tree to advance your technology and always know what to do next.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your save will transfer to the full game, probably.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128770/extras/97c6ff488c4fa14e86821bc516958cae.poster.avif?t=1754425166\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128770/extras/97c6ff488c4fa14e86821bc516958cae.webm?t=1754425166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128770/extras/97c6ff488c4fa14e86821bc516958cae.mp4?t=1754425166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>This is the prologue for the full game and it includes the first stage of terraforming the world from the beginning of the apocalypse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prologue owners will get a special discount on the full game.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization has turned STONE.<br>Revive the people, terraform the world, defend against the apocalypse, and rebuild civilization from the stone age to advanced technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dust and statues are all that\u2019s left - it\u2019s up to you now, survivor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Survival Crafting Base Building Game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather dust and craft your way up to rebuilding civilization, from the stone age to advanced technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive people from the stone and build homes for them to work at your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new workstations and machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make water and food to maintain your character in the harsh apocalypse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against mutants from the apocalypse using melee/ranged weapons and defense structures like wooden spikes and castle walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform the world by building machines to alter the atmosphere and watch the world transform to its original state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a tech tree to advance your technology and always know what to do next.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your save will transfer to the full game, probably.</p>",
